        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.819,
            0.801,
            0.86
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 3:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " It is known that 12345 – 5432 + 135 – 24 – (–67) = 7091. What is the value of the expression 12345 – 5432 + 135 – 24?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
